' Spec sections 3, 6 and 7: a typed-in quiz with DATA, DEF FN, ON ... GOSUB and WHILE.
10 MODE 1:PEN 1:PAPER 0:CLS
20 DEF FN pct(a,b)=INT(a*100/b)
30 RESTORE 500
40 WHILE q<3
50 READ q$,a$
60 ? q$;:INPUT r$
70 IF UPPER$(r$)=a$ THEN GOSUB 300 ELSE GOSUB 400
80 q=q+1
90 WEND
100 ? "YOU SCORED ";FN pct(ok,3);"%"
110 ON ok+1 GOTO 120,130,140,150
120 ? "TRY AGAIN":END
130 ? "NOT BAD":END
140 ? "WELL DONE":END
150 ? "PERFECT":END
300 ok=ok+1:? "RIGHT":RETURN
400 ? "WRONG":RETURN
500 DATA "CAPITAL OF FRANCE?",PARIS
510 DATA "CAPITAL OF SPAIN?",MADRID
520 DATA "CAPITAL OF ITALY?",ROME
